        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86440, Back-to-Back Trail Front Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trail Back-to-Back Handle Pair is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. Choose from a wide selection of contemporary finishes. The Back-to-Back Trail Front Door Pull Set is great for modern homes. It comes packaged with the hardware to back-to-back mount the pair of pulls on doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/modern-trail-thru-bolt-handle-emtek-86440\"><b>Trail Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Trail Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86440-specifications.pdf?v=1704262361\"><b>Emtek Trail Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86440:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86441:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
